Package: CompositionalOMP
Type: Package
Title: The Compositional Regression-Orthogonal Matching Pursuit Variable Selection Algorithm
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-11-24
Authors@R: person("Michail", "Tsagris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mtsagris@uoc.gr")
Author: Michail Tsagris [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Michail Tsagris <mtsagris@uoc.gr>
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: Compositional, CompositionalSR, minpack.lm, parallel, rangen, Rfast, stats
