Description: The Compositional Regression-Orthogonal Matching Pursuit (CR-OMP) is an adaptation of the gamma-OMP variable selection algorithm for compositional responses. Dirichlet regression or alpha-regression may be employed, and cross-validation is available for both models. References: Tsagris M. (2026) <doi:10.1101/431734>. 
